| B4 | BEHAVIOUR | QR carries the invite string the vessel already takes as data ("by QR, by paste", `open-browser-vessel.ts:246-258`). Adds a decoder and camera road, no format. |
| B5 | BEHAVIOUR | A real-browser proof walk. |
| B6 | BEHAVIOUR | A walk (rung 4). |
